<title>GERMANY: SOCCER-GERMAN CUP SEMIFINAL RESULT.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-GERMAN CUP SEMIFINAL RESULT.</headline>
<dateline>STUTTGART, Germany 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of a German Cup semifinal on Wednesday:</p>
<p> VfB Stuttgart	2	Hamburg	1  (halftime 1-1)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>VfB Stuttgart - Krassimir Balakow 15, Thomas Schneider 60</p>
<p>Hamburg - Juergen Hartmann 19</p>
<p>Attendance: 48,000.</p>
</text>
